              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lisa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I doubled batch as cookies just disappear at our house. I add cream of tartar about 1/2 tsp for dble batch and almond extract 1tsp. I decreased the sugar to just under 3/4 cups. Omg they look and taste awesome. I am going to dip half in dark chocolate. Have never mastered these before wondering if it is the kitchen aid mixer we got. They were never this beautiful consistency before. So easy too!",
