            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Guillaume Lastnamh"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Doubled the recipe, but used only the minimum sugar required to achieve a glossy meringue (about 2 tbsp). If you use sweetened coconut, you really don't need to add any extra sweetness. \n\nI made 20 from the batch. Approximately 20 minutes at 375 C gave nice browned tips with soft centres.",
            "datePublished": "2018-07-11T08:00:37.960Z"
          },
