              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lori Holt"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very easy. And I took someone else's recommendations from the reviews and added almond extract too. Melted chocolate chips in the microwave for a minute or so and pipe on with a baggie to decorate with chocolate.",
            "datePublished": "2015-04-08T13:59:03.993Z"
