              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "miki"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These r super easy and very good. I followed a tip from another review and used a bit less sugar and and added a bit of vanilla. I also ground about 12 almonds into powder (about a 1/4 cup) and added that to my coconut, using about 1 3/4 cup coconut. They are beautiful and toasted looking. Super easy!!",
            "datePublished": "2017-04-12T20:07:40.180Z"
