              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mhy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a winner! This made exactly 12 macaroons using a 1-Tablespoon cookie scoop. Per previous recommendations, I cut the sugar in half (total 1/4 cup per batch) and I use unsweetened coconut flakes (because that's all that I had). In the next batch, I will try the 1 teaspoon of almond extract and unsweetened shredded coconut. Once cooled, I dipped half the macaroon into melted dark chocolate (see my photos). Let's just say that the 1st batch disappeared and now I can't wait to make a second batch.",
